00:29:06.330 --> 00:29:19.200
this volume of seawater here has been displaced by the iceberg. The actual iceberg has taken its

00:29:19.200 --> 00:29:27.660
place and that displacement of that seawater causes a buoyancy force upwards and it&#x27;s governed

00:29:27.660 --> 00:29:36.260
by Archimedes principle. The formula for buoyancy force is fb equals rho which is density,

00:29:39.690 --> 00:29:49.930
