The definition is the push or a pull between charged objects or particles and again we&#x27;re

00:31:00.150 --> 00:31:05.670
going to look at this in much more detail later on in the IB course. The key point here is the

00:31:05.670 --> 00:31:13.850
opposites attract. You can see these two charges, positive and negative, they are opposites to each

00:31:13.850 --> 00:31:18.950
other so they attract, they pull towards each other. The opposite happens when you have like

