electron. They repel and that&#x27;s what&#x27;s causing this poor little baby&#x27;s hair to stand on end and

00:31:40.610 --> 00:31:47.310
repel from each other. Finally magnetic force which has the notation f underscore m. The

00:31:47.310 --> 00:31:52.450
definition of the magnetic force is the force of attraction or repulsion between two objects

00:31:52.450 --> 00:31:59.390
due to their magnetic properties and again just like charges like magnetic poles repel

00:31:59.390 --> 00:32:06.670
and unlike magnetic poles attract. Let&#x27;s head to your revision notes. Write down the definition

