At v1 that speed is perhaps let&#x27;s say 500 meters per second and at v2

00:52:52.730 --> 00:53:01.350
the speed is the same it&#x27;s 500 meters per second. It&#x27;s a constant speed but the velocity is changing.

00:53:01.350 --> 00:53:07.670
The velocity is changing because at v1 the direction is that way and for v2 the direction

00:53:07.670 --> 00:53:15.430
is that way. If a velocity is changing then the object is accelerating and that&#x27;s because

00:53:15.430 --> 00:53:22.010
